Package: worldcuphost
Title: Measure Home Country Advantage in the FIFA World Cup
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Gopika", "Nair", email = "gopikanair2026@u.northwestern.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for measuring whether national teams perform better
    when their country hosts the FIFA World Cup. Includes a dataset of
    every men's World Cup match and functions to find a country's hosting
    years and compare its results as host versus not host.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Gopeeks/worldcuphost
BugReports: https://github.com/Gopeeks/worldcuphost/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
LazyData: true
